"entity": {
"name": "Etablissements Maurel & Prom SA",
"description": "\u00c9tablissements Maurel & Prom SA is an oil and gas exploration and production company. It operates through the following three segments: Production, Exploration, and Drilling. The Production segment provides hydrocarbon and petroleum products. The Exploration segment offers services such as geographical surveys, seismic acquisitions and processing, geographical interpretation, and drilling. The Drilling segment is involved in the creation of a passageway through the surface of earth to take samples and extract fluid substance. The company was founded in 1831 and is headquartered in Paris, France.",
